		{
			"id": "DmBiKfYi",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 100,
			"y": 2020,
			"width": 675,
			"height": 230.39999999999998,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1201,
			"version": 2,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Each relationship is a PAIR of attributes (one on each side), linked by associated_attribute_id:\n\n  Attribute Slug          On Object    Type         Paired With             Cardinality\n  ─────────────────────── ─────────── ──────────── ─────────────────────── ─────────────\n  contact_company         CONTACT      ASSOCIATION  company_contacts        Many→One\n  company_contacts        COMPANY      ASSOCIATION  contact_company         One→Many\n  contact_deals           CONTACT      ASSOCIATION  deal_contacts           Many↔Many\n  deal_contacts           DEAL         ASSOCIATION  contact_deals           Many↔Many\n  contact_meetings        CONTACT      ASSOCIATION  meeting_contacts        Many↔Many\n  meeting_contacts        MEETING      ASSOCIATION  contact_meetings        Many↔Many\n  company_deals           COMPANY      ASSOCIATION  deal_company            One→Many\n  deal_company            DEAL         ASSOCIATION  company_deals           Many→One\n  company_meetings        COMPANY      ASSOCIATION  meeting_company         One→Many\n  meeting_company         MEETING      ASSOCIATION  company_meetings        Many→One\n  deal_meetings           DEAL         ASSOCIATION  meeting_deals           Many↔Many\n  meeting_deals           MEETING      ASSOCIATION  deal_meetings           Many↔Many",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Each relationship is a PAIR of attributes (one on each side), linked by associated_attribute_id:\n\n  Attribute Slug          On Object    Type         Paired With             Cardinality\n  ─────────────────────── ─────────── ──────────── ─────────────────────── ─────────────\n  contact_company         CONTACT      ASSOCIATION  company_contacts        Many→One\n  company_contacts        COMPANY      ASSOCIATION  contact_company         One→Many\n  contact_deals           CONTACT      ASSOCIATION  deal_contacts           Many↔Many\n  deal_contacts           DEAL         ASSOCIATION  contact_deals           Many↔Many\n  contact_meetings        CONTACT      ASSOCIATION  meeting_contacts        Many↔Many\n  meeting_contacts        MEETING      ASSOCIATION  contact_meetings        Many↔Many\n  company_deals           COMPANY      ASSOCIATION  deal_company            One→Many\n  deal_company            DEAL         ASSOCIATION  company_deals           Many→One\n  company_meetings        COMPANY      ASSOCIATION  meeting_company         One→Many\n  meeting_company         MEETING      ASSOCIATION  company_meetings        Many→One\n  deal_meetings           DEAL         ASSOCIATION  meeting_deals           Many↔Many\n  meeting_deals           MEETING      ASSOCIATION  deal_meetings           Many↔Many",
			"autoResize": true,
